MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_001: Hey, Promised One! I can't take it anymore!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_002: Wh-where's everyone going? Whatever! I don't need\nthem around anyway.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_003: <NCA>"Calm down."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_004: <NCB>"What is it?"
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_005: <ACA>I am calm. I'm super calm! I'm just mad at you!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_006: <ACB>There's something I need you to explain, because\nI've been wondering about it for a while.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_007: We're out to crush Balor, right? Together, I mean.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_008: That's why we're out there risking our lives every\nsingle day, yeah?
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_009: So why ain't I getting admired like you do?
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_030: People admire you because you're beautiful and\nstrong, but I wanna be admired too!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_010: Instead, I just get yelled at by everyone! Generals,\nvulkans, everyone!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_011: Even though I'm doing great on the battlefield, I still\ndon't get respect. It's no different from back home.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_012: And, ya know, fine. I might be annoying, but I'd like\na little credit for helping to take Balor down.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_013: <NCA>"Why do you want so much to be admired?"
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_014: Well, because it feels good. Obviously. And, you\nknow, it's proof that I'm needed.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_015: Argh...
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_016: You don't think I'm a nuisance, do you?\nPlease, tell me you don't.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_017: <NCA>"You are my friend."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_018: <NCB>"You have been a great help."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_019: <ACA>Heh, you're my friend too!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_020: <ACB>E-exactly! You can't handle everything by yourself!\nYou can rely on me. Even more than you have!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_021: You've got a good eye for talent. Maybe that's the\nsecret to why everybody likes you.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_022: Hey, if you think about other people's feelings,\nit makes them feel good, yeah?
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_023: <NCA>"That's right."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_024: So maybe women avoid me because... Oh, y'know,\nit's probably because I'm so strong and intimidating.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_025: Am I wrong? Like those guys who took off earlier.\nThen again, I guess strong women avoid me too.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_026: Maybe everyone's just shy. That must be it. After all,\nit's the only thing that makes sense.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_027: But, that's a problem. I can't change the fact that\nI'm so strong it makes people nervous.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_028: For now, I'm just gonna worry about defeating Balor!\nAfter that, everyone will be fighting to talk to me!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_A_029: Yeah, I'm gonna take him down! I'm fighting for\nthe happiness of all the women in the world!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_001: They're really not coming back, are they? Damn!\nI can't accept it! I just can't.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_002: If I knew it'd turn out like this, I woulda stayed...
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_003: I thought they'd be fine. They were so strong, but...\nNow I'm crying! Damn!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_004: <NCA>"Everything is OK."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_005: <NCB>"It's OK to cry, even if you're strong."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_006: <ACA>Y-you're late! I was waiting for you to come back.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_007: <ACA>But, you never did! And n-now, I... I'm hungry!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_008: <ACB>Sh-shut up! I'm not crying!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_009: <ACB>Besides, you're the strong one. Me, I'm thinking real\nhard about going home.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_010: Since you're still alive, I guess I'll forgive you.\nBut there's still something I don't understand.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_011: The battle's over. Fighting's done. I saved the world...\nAnd there's still no women coming my way.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_012: Don't laugh! Everyone that I fall for would rather\nbe with someone like you!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_013: Seriously, I don't get it. Why isn't there anyone\nwho wants me?
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_014: <NCA>"I can see why it strikes you as strange."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_015: Right? How can somebody as strong as me...
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_016: Ya know, you're pretty weird. You listen to all my\nnonsense and...well, it makes me feel needed.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_017: But the world has already been saved. You don't\nreally need me around anymore.
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_018: <NCA>"I always have need of you."
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_019: R-really? You do?
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_020: <RSDS>If that's the case, why didn't you say so before?\nYou're so bad at being open and honest!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_021: Well then, let's go! I got no idea what we're doing,\nbut I don't think it matters! I'm ready!
MID_SE_Ism_Dai_S_022: I'm always gonna be there for you, Promised One.\nForever and ever!